# RAGLab Project Setup and Collaboration Instructions

## 1. Project Overview

We are two developers collaborating on a project named **RAGLab**, a RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) evaluation, benchmarking, and diagnostic platform.

This is our first project working together. We have similar experience levels, and both of us want to learn all parts of the project rather than permanently dividing the work into frontend and backend roles.

We work asynchronously in our free time, usually a few sessions per week. Therefore, the project must have a clear structure, understandable documentation, small milestones, and reliable handoffs.

**Important:** RAGLab is primarily a RAG evaluation and benchmarking platform, not simply a chatbot.

